; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; The girl Yalmog'iz kampir keeps in a cage by her hut -- Inuciian's "Damsel"
; (the owner, 2026-10-10). Qiz for now: her name, and what freeing her is worth,
; are the owner's to decide -- see docs/plan/2026-10-01-campaign.md.
;
; A person, neutral and bodiless as the commander. Her model is her in the cage
; on its gibbet, the cage swinging (her own file's clip, Idle); she stands at the
; cell under the cage. Out of it she is models/characters/people/damsel.glb.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Monster
  Name = Damsel
  DisplayName = Qiz
  KindOf = [INFANTRY, SELECTABLE]
  Geometry = Cylinder
    Radius = 4
    Height = 12
  End
  VisionRange = 0
  MinDepth = 99
  Weight = 0
  Colour = 0xD8C070
  Scale = 1.0
  Model = models/characters/people/damsel_caged.glb
  ModelScale = 1
  Facing = 90
  Idle = Idle
End
